  SIKLAB Authors

Dave Buena
- Creator and Founder of Project SIKLAB.
- Conceived and initiated the SIKLAB Desktop Humanoid Robotics Project in 2026.
- Designed and developed the project's initial system architecture.
- Developed the initial robotics integration and ROS 2 architecture.
- Developed the initial AI and autonomous systems architecture.
- Developed the embedded systems and hardware integration.
- Designed and developed the initial mechanical architecture and hardware.
- Established the project's original technical direction, development roadmap, and system design.
- Started SIKLAB while studying Bachelor of Science in Robotics Engineering at IU International University of Applied Sciences.

