   Contributors

Additional contributors to SIKLAB will be acknowledged here as the project develops.

Contributions do not alter the attribution of the original creation and founding of the SIKLAB project.

---

   Project Origin

SIKLAB was created by Dave Buena in 2026 as an independent desktop humanoid robotics project focused on robotics, artificial intelligence, embodied AI, computer vision, autonomous systems, and human–robot interaction.
